1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Beolhyu Isageum (伐休泥師今, ?-196, reigned: 184-196) was the ninth king of Silla and the 7th king to use the title of Isageum. He is the grandson of Talhae Isa-geum and the son of Gaggan Guchu (仇 鄒). His mother is the 
2 CONC wife of the Kim family. As Adalala Issa-geum had no children[1], the Park dynasty was temporarily cut off, and the throne returned to the Seok family.
